The Tank Cat Stack 'em High Campaign returns for summer!

Can you send us enough Likes for Tank Cat to reach the top of the tower? Or beyond?!

The more Likes we receive on Stack 'em High campaign posts, the more Cat Food you can earn at the end of the campaign!

・15000 Likes: 30 Cat Food<br>
・30000 Likes +30 Cat Food（Total: 60 Cat Food!）<br>
